    restoration_trigger: "an executing census or lane with a declared ceiling can ingest those six live subjects as claims (native ingest, or interpreted ingest whose per-file cost fits the 300s census and whose glob walk fits the 8s changed-witness wall) so the six identities are test fns that call file_gate and reach PASS or a discriminating RED on that run. Passing under claim_batch is the declared state, not the trigger."
  }
